WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,690
All things make people

2
00:00:02,170 --> 00:00:04,970
Good to burn the world

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:17,020
The Dharma of the Demonic Sect

4
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:19,250
You are from the Demon Sect

5
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,650
Blind your dog eyes

6
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:22,890
I told you that I am not a demon cultivator

7
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:50,030
Too strong

8
00:00:50,430 --> 00:00:51,990
I really did not misjudge the person.

9
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,450
Should we go up and help? No need

10
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,660
It’s okay for the Holy Son to be alone

11
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:01,270
We should settle the score with him.
